			],
			"audioLanguages": ["en", "en", "en"],
			"image": "/thai-script/lessons/lesson-02/images/the-trick-81194bde30c4.jpg"
		},
		{
			"kind": "exposition",
			"id": "meet-ngu",
			"heading": "The first voice",
			"body": [
				"Its name is the sound, then a word beginning with that sound.",
				"The word means *snake*.",
				"You already make this sound — at the *end* of sing. Thai lets it lead."
			],
